        "subject": "LU-20337 tests: fix obdfilter-survey to parse IPv6",
        "message": "LU-20337 tests: fix obdfilter-survey to parse IPv6\n\nobdfilter-survey uses a `:` delimiter to parse `host:device`. When\nthe host is an IPv6 address, which contains multiple embedded `:`,\nthe parsing fails. The fix is to split the string on the last `:`.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=obdfilter-survey\nSigned-off-by: Xinxia Qu <xqu@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I4c8da5669dc4ba99040eda10d6d4d29966c53de6\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66518\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Jian Yu <yujian@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
